// Norwegian layout with brackets on ø/æ keys
// ø → (    Shift+ø → [    AltGr+ø → ø    AltGr+Shift+ø → Ø
// æ → )    Shift+æ → ]    AltGr+æ → æ    AltGr+Shift+æ → Æ
//
// Modifier mapping:
// Physical Option   → Super (Mod4)   — the niri compositor Mod
// Physical Left Cmd → ISO_Level3_Shift (Mod5/AltGr) — types ø/æ/@ and brackets
// Physical Right Cmd→ Alt   (Mod1)   — macOS-style shortcut modifier (Cmd+C/V/...)

default partial alphanumeric_keys modifier_keys
xkb_symbols "basic" {
    include "no(mac)"

    key <AC10> { type = "FOUR_LEVEL", [ parenleft,  bracketleft,  oslash, Oslash ] };
    key <AC11> { type = "FOUR_LEVEL", [ parenright, bracketright, ae,     AE     ] };

    // 4 key: US-style $ on Shift, € on AltGr (no(mac) default is ¤ on Shift, $ on AltGr).
    // AltGr+Shift keeps ¤ around in case it's ever needed.
    key <AE04> { type = "FOUR_LEVEL", [ 4, dollar, EuroSign, currency ] };

    // Option -> Super (Mod). Left Cmd -> Level3 (AltGr, types ø/æ). Right Cmd -> Alt (shortcuts).
    key <LALT> { [ Super_L ] };
    key <RALT> { type[Group1] = "TWO_LEVEL", [ Super_R, Super_R ] };
    key <LWIN> { type[Group1] = "ONE_LEVEL", [ ISO_Level3_Shift ] };
    key <RWIN> { type[Group1] = "ONE_LEVEL", [ Alt_L ] };

    modifier_map Mod4 { <LALT>, <RALT> };
    modifier_map Mod5 { <LWIN> };
    modifier_map Mod1 { <RWIN> };
};
